# Generated large knowledge shards: reproducible locally via
# scripts/sanad_ultimate_core.py and scripts/build_knowledge_banks.py.
# Curated small files stay tracked; generated bulk stays local to keep
# the repo honest and cloneable. Uncomment to track them if needed.
data/knowledge/gen_supreme_core_*.txt
data/knowledge/mega_libraries/*.txt

# Heritage mega-books (local only, large .txt from public-domain editions).
# Tracked: nothing. Place verified public-domain .txt files here and inject with:
# python scripts/sanad_safe_injector.py --dir raw/mega_libraries --dataset sanad-mega --prefix real_
raw/mega_libraries/*.txt
!raw/mega_libraries/.gitkeep
